      <nav class="sitewide-sections__nav">
        <a href="#hero">Hero</a>
        <a href="#layout">Layout</a>
        <a href="#cards">Cards</a>
        <a href="#content">Content</a>
        <a href="#media">Media</a>
        <a href="#cta">CTA</a>
        <a href="#forms">Forms</a>
        <a href="#navigation">Navigation</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  {# ============================================
     CATEGORY: Hero Sections
     Full-width hero/banner sections
     ============================================ #}
  <section class="sitewide-sections__category" id="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Hero Sections</h2>
      <p>Full-width hero banners for page headers and landing sections.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- ============================================
         SECTION: Hero Split
         Category: Hero
         Description: Split hero with static CTA left and seasonal slider right
         Modifiers: none
         ============================================ -->
    <article class="sitewide-sections__item">
      <header class="sitewide-sections__item-header">
        <h3>.hero-split</h3>
        <p>Split-screen hero with static content/CTAs on the left and a seasonal promotional slider on the right. Left panel has heading, description, and up to 3 CTA buttons (each with title + URL fields — if a button field is empty, that button is hidden). Right panel uses a repeater field for seasonal slides; each slide has a background image, heading, text, and optional button. If any field in a slide is not filled out, that element is hidden on the front end.</p>
        <dl class="sitewide-sections__meta">
          <dt>Left Panel:</dt>
          <dd>Heading, description, 3 button fields (title + URL each) — conditional display</dd>
          <dt>Right Panel:</dt>
          <dd>Repeater: slides (background image, heading, text, button title, button URL)</dd>
          <dt>Image:</dt>
          <dd>Right panel background per slide (CSS background-image)</dd>
          <dt>Conditional:</dt>
          <dd>Empty button fields or slide fields are hidden from front end</dd>
        </dl>
      </header>
      <div class="sitewide-sections__example">
        {% include "hero.njk" %}
      </div>
    </article>

    <!-- ============================================
         SECTION: Page Hero
         Category: Hero
         Description: Full-width background image hero with overlay, heading, and text
         Modifiers: none
         ============================================ -->
