        <p>Full-width background image hero with dark overlay, centered heading, and description text. Used for subpage banners. Configure via front matter: heroHeading, heroText, heroImage. If any field is empty, that element is hidden.</p>
        <dl class="sitewide-sections__meta">
          <dt>Image:</dt>
          <dd>Full-width background (CSS background-image, cover)</dd>
          <dt>Fields:</dt>
          <dd>heroHeading, heroText, heroImage (front matter)</dd>
          <dt>Conditional:</dt>
          <dd>All fields — if empty, element is hidden</dd>
        </dl>
      </header>
