    <!-- ============================================
         SECTION: Content Split
         Category: Layout
         Description: 50/50 square columns — image + content, with optional reverse
         Modifiers: --reverse (image right, content left)
         ============================================ -->
    <article class="sitewide-sections__item">
      <header class="sitewide-sections__item-header">
        <h3>.content-split</h3>
        <p>Two-column 50/50 layout with square proportions. Image column and content column (eyebrow, heading, text, up to 2 buttons). Use <code>--reverse</code> modifier to flip image to the right side. Background color of content panel is selectable from style guide palette. If any field (eyebrow, button, etc.) is not filled out, that element is hidden.</p>
        <dl class="sitewide-sections__meta">
          <dt>Modifiers:</dt>
          <dd>--reverse (image right, content left)</dd>
          <dt>Image:</dt>
          <dd>5:4 aspect ratio, object-fit: cover</dd>
          <dt>Background:</dt>
          <dd>Content panel: selectable from style guide colors (default: --color-dusk)</dd>
          <dt>Optional:</dt>
          <dd>Eyebrow, buttons — hidden if empty</dd>
          <dt>Conditional:</dt>
          <dd>All optional fields — if empty, element is hidden</dd>
        </dl>
      </header>

      {# Default: image left, content right #}
      <div class="sitewide-sections__example">
        <section class="content-split">
          <div class="content-split__image content-split__image--center">
