    <article class="sitewide-sections__item">
      <header class="sitewide-sections__item-header">
        <h3>.flip-cards-area</h3>
        <p>Three interactive flip cards. Front shows choosable icon (FontAwesome), title, and subtitle. Back shows title and 1–3 CTA buttons (repeater field, max 3 per card). Text and buttons are centered vertically on the back. Flips on hover/tap/focus. If any field is not filled out, that element is hidden.</p>
        <dl class="sitewide-sections__meta">
          <dt>Cards:</dt>
          <dd>3 (responsive: stacks on mobile)</dd>
          <dt>Front:</dt>
          <dd>Icon (choosable FontAwesome class), title, subtitle — each hidden if empty</dd>
          <dt>Back:</dt>
          <dd>Title + repeater: 1–3 buttons (title + URL each, max 3) — centered vertically</dd>
